GC_LobbyGameMode : "{A79C4E0A43DEB821}Prefabs/MP/Modes/GC_LobbyGameMode.et" {
 ID "62FCEFC754BFFE2B"
 components {
  GC_LobbyManager "{6A137A39106A4973}" {
   m_aMissionEvents + {
    GC_Event "{3CC6823085644083}" {
     m_sName "Time Limit (event 3, 4620s)"
     m_Advanced GC_EventOptions "{D3B24152CD13A16B}" {
      m_fDelay 4620
     }
     m_aActions {
      GC_MessageAction "{0108EA6E8789F819}" {
       m_sTitle "Rebel Minor Victory"
       m_sMessage "Time limit reached. Now, die with honor."
      }
     }
    }
   }
   m_aBriefings {
    GC_Briefing "{3C3BD71CCBB42B3D}" {
     m_iOrder 0
     m_sTitle "Overview"
     m_sContent "Somewhere in Syria, rebels conduct a delaying action while Russians attempt to push them back, deeper into the city. 7 minute setup timer."\
     ""\
     "Mission created by Gabe"
     m_eAudience 1
    }
    GC_Briefing "{C07274988DE69369}" {
     m_iOrder 1
     m_sTitle "Brief"
     m_sContent "<h1><b><u>Friendly</h1></b></u>"\
     "Friendly forces are, at most, a company of Russian infantry (located to the south) with 4x TIGR vehicles (AGS/KORD, ironsight, exposed gunner) as support to be used at the commander's discretion. Your mission is to take South Side and North Side; kill all Rebels you encounter. If you make up 90% of the population in an objective, you take it."\
     ""\
     "<h1><b><u>Enemy</h1></b></u>"\
     "The enemy is, at most, 32 anti-Assad rebel fighters located up north in the city. There're probably some ISIS terrorists in the mix, too, so don't feel too bad. They will likely conduct a delaying action at the first objective, using RPGs and small arms to ambush and then fallback (if they're smart). Expect to encounter AT mines."
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "RHS_AFRF"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{0AF62309F67A0605}" {
     m_iOrder 2
     m_sTitle "Brief"
     m_sContent "<h1><b><u>Friendly</h1></b></u>"\
     "Friendly forces are, at most, 32 anti-Assad rebel fighters up north. The overarching plan is to conduct a delaying action using RPGs and small arms to ambush and then fallback. It would be wise not to over-commit to defending the southern objective area. By spawn, there are 4x sedans and 2x Ural trucks to be used for transportation. There are 8x AT mines in each Ural truck."\
     ""\
     "<h1><b><u>Enemy</h1></b></u>"\
     "The enemy is, at most, a company of Russian infantry with as many as 4x TIGR vehicles (AGS/KORD, ironsight, exposed gunner), all located to the south. They are attempting to push us back further into the city. Their approach options are limited due to excessive mines and the urban environment. We expect them to take control of the 2x marked objective areas. If they make up 90% of the population in an objective area, it will be captured."\
     ""\
     ""
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "GC_INSURGENT"
     }
    }
